WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.451 --> 00:00:03.547
CINEMATOGRAPHY IS ONE OF
THOSE JOBS THAT YOU HAVE

00:00:03.547 --> 00:00:06.650
ABSOLUTELY HEARD OF,
BUT STILL DON'T

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.090
QUITE UNDERSTAND COMPLETELY.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.420
BUT IF YOU WANTED TO,
THIS GROUP HAS

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.920
THE KNOWLEDGE YOU SEEK.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.940
IN "JUDAS AND THE BLACK
MESSIAH," SEAN BOBBIT FINDS

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:20.805
EXCITEMENT IN RESPONDING
TO WHAT ACTORS DO WHEN

00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:22.890
THEY ARE IN A SPACE.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:26.109
IN "MANK," ERIK
MESSERSCHMIDT LOVES

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:28.065
PREDICTING THE
MOMENT OF AN ACTOR.

00:00:28.924 --> 00:00:32.339
IN "NEWS OF THE WORLD,"
DARIUSZ WOLSKI LOVES

00:00:32.339 --> 00:00:36.590
THE NUANCES THAT THE 
ENVIRONMENT BRINGS TO A SCENE.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.090
IN "NOMADLAND," JOSHUA
JAMES RICHARDS WAS

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:42.290
INSPIRED BY ALLOWING PEOPLE
TO EXIST NATURALLY

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:43.788
WITHIN A RAW LANDSCAPE.

00:00:44.395 --> 00:00:48.460
AND FINALLY, IN "THE TRIAL OF
THE CHICAGO 7," PHEDON

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:52.835
PAPAMICHAEL, FINDS A VISUAL
LANGUAGE TO ESTABLISH A PULSE.

00:00:55.026 --> 00:00:57.154
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:03.634
ERIK MESSERSCHMIDT,
"MANK."

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:07.098
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:01:31.243 --> 00:01:32.749
WOW.

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:36.690
UM, WOW.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.800
I WISH I COULD CUT
THIS INTO FIVE PIECES

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:42.920
’CAUSE IT’S SUCH AN HONOR
TO BE NOMINATED

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.019
AMONGST ALL OF YOU.

00:01:45.019 --> 00:01:48.190
IT’S AN INCREDIBLE HONOR.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:51.710
DAVID, THANK YOU.

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.820
THANK YOU FOR CREATING
AN ENVIRONMENT WHERE

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:57.390
WE COULD DO OUR
BEST WORK

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:01.430
AND I GOT TO GO
HOME AND FEEL LIKE I GAVE

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.630
IT MY ALL EVERY NIGHT.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:04.960
THANK YOU.

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:10.619
CEAN, THANK YOU FOR
THE ENDLESS SUPPORT.

00:02:10.619 --> 00:02:13.510
ERIC ROTH, THANK YOU
FOR THE GUIDANCE.

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:19.480
AMANDA, GARY, WHAT A
PRIVILEGE AND A JOY TO

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:21.150
WATCH YOU WORK.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.540
THE ENTIRE CAST,
THANK YOU FOR HITTING

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:23.720
YOUR MARKS.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.906
IT MATTERED.

00:02:27.849 --> 00:02:31.010
AND IT’S -- THIS REALLY
BELONGS TO AN EXTRAORDINARY

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:35.530
CREW WHO I COULD NOT
DO ANYTHING WITHOUT.

00:02:36.596 --> 00:02:45.090
BRIAN, WILL, ALEX, DAVE,
GARY, DWAYNE, DANNY, JERRY

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:50.270
AND ALL OF YOUR TEAM,
YOU MAKE MY JOB EASY.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.270
THANK YOU.

00:02:52.681 --> 00:02:55.651
AND THANK YOU TO MY
BEAUTIFUL WIFE NAIARA

00:02:55.651 --> 00:02:58.570
WHO TOLERATES THIS CRAZY
BUSINESS AND HELPED ME

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:01.180
GET THROUGH THIS MOVIE,
SO THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.422
THANK YOU.

